  "body": "After many happy years, our owner has bought her next home in a retirement village. Now this much-loved 1970s brick and block townhouse is ready for its next chapter - opening the door for you to secure a sunny spot in sought-after Milford.\r\n\r\nOccupying the prized north-facing end position, the home has been freshened up and presents well, with three bedrooms and two bathrooms across two levels. It has a welcoming feel, a practical layout and plenty of scope to add your own touch.\r\n\r\nOpen-plan living flows onto an elevated, sunny balcony, where morning coffee could easily become a long afternoon with friends. Downstairs, a second private balcony offers a quieter place to unwind, while the generous exclusive-use yard adds even more space to enjoy.\r\n\r\nLeave the car at home and stroll to Milford Mall, linger over a flat white at your favourite cafes, or finish the day with sand between your toes at Milford Beach. When life calls you further afield, the motorway, Busway station, Smales Farm and North Shore Hospital are all within easy reach. Families will love the zoning for Milford Primary, TNIS, and both Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools.\r\n\r\nFor peace of mind, this property was NOT affected by any of the severe weather events in 2023.\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE;\r\n* A sunny end position: north-facing, with beautiful natural light.\r\n* Room to spread out: three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a flexible layout over two levels.\r\n* Outdoor options: a sunny upstairs balcony, a private downstairs balcony and a generous exclusive-use yard.\r\n* Comfort now, potential ahead: freshened up and very liveable, with room to add your own style and value.\r\n* Parking sorted: double garaging with internal access, an additional off-street park and roomy storage.\r\n* Prime location: a short walk to Milford Shopping Centre, cafes & restaurants, and Milford Beach.\r\n* Excellent School Zones: Milford Primary, TNIS, and both Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your first home, a comfortable downsize or a smart investment in a sound position, this one deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nOur owner's next chapter is secured. Now it's your opportunity to claim yours.\r\nCome for the sunshine, see the potential and make your move!\r\n\r\nAgents and flippers welcome - conjunctional offers invited from day one. \r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 12 November 2026 from 5pm at Ray White Milford (Unless Sold Prior)\r\nINFO: rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35825 (scroll down to documents)",
